# .env keys that are RETIRED: nothing reads them any more, so the stack is
# correct with or without the line, but the line does nothing.
#
# ONE source of truth, read by both:
#   - scripts/lib-addons.sh  warn_retired_env_keys  (the launcher's WARN)
#   - noo onboard --only env  (offers to remove them; noo-cli embeds this file)
#
# Format: KEY|what replaced it (one line; shown after "which is RETIRED and ignored —")
# Keys the launcher REFUSES on (NOO_*_ENABLED add-on flags) are not listed
# here: lib-addons.sh addons_guard_retired_flags owns those.
