NOO_VLLM_TLS|every backend door is mTLS unconditionally, and a false value makes the node agent refuse to start
NOO_LLAMACPP_TLS|every backend door is mTLS unconditionally, and a false value makes the node agent refuse to start
NOO_OLLAMA_TLS|every backend door is mTLS unconditionally, and a false value makes the node agent refuse to start
